      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST SENATOR.\nWith those legions\nWhich I have spoke of, whereunto your levy\nMust be supplyant. The words of your commission\nWill tie you to the numbers and the time\nOf their dispatch.",
